    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>Monstrix TCG Card Shop</i></strong>, you take on the role of a card collector shop owner, managing every aspect of your own trading card store. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock your shelves with the latest trading card packs, exclusive figurines of beloved game characters, and rare collectibles. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your shop\u2019s interior to attract more customers and create the ultimate card shop experience. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your business as your popularity grows\u2014unlock larger spaces and design unique areas for players to come in and play the trading card game right in your store! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only can you run a thriving shop, but you can also curate your own personal card collection, hunting down rare cards to show off or trade. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become the top destination for collectors, players, and fans in <strong>Monstrix TCG Card Shop</strong>!</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>Monstrix TCG Card Shop</i></strong>, you take on the role of a card collector shop owner, managing every aspect of your own trading card store. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock your shelves with the latest trading card packs, exclusive figurines of beloved game characters, and rare collectibles. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your shop\u2019s interior to attract more customers and create the ultimate card shop experience. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your business as your popularity grows\u2014unlock larger spaces and design unique areas for players to come in and play the trading card game right in your store! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only can you run a thriving shop, but you can also curate your own personal card collection, hunting down rare cards to show off or trade. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become the top destination for collectors, players, and fans in <strong>Monstrix TCG Card Shop</strong>!</h2>",
